{"unit_id": "GeekRicardo__dsh-balance#feature-1", "repo": "GeekRicardo/dsh-balance", "commit": "bb64f55accac6c3f3cccf05ab499db46f665ea2e", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-balance 的功能「供应商余额与配额」：根据当前 provider 查询 DeepSeek、Kimi、OpenCode Go、智谱、MiniMax、OpenRouter 或 Codex 的余额/用量，并由状态栏展示。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:1054-1068", "lib/client.js:156-323"]}
