{"unit_id": "GeekRicardo__dsh-balance#feature-3", "repo": "GeekRicardo/dsh-balance", "commit": "bb64f55accac6c3f3cccf05ab499db46f665ea2e", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-balance 的功能「缓存状态栏读数」：网页端每两秒请求本机状态接口，并先显示上次成功读数，减少切换会话时的空白。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:353-390"]}
